sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as External Client
    participant Gateway as Istio Gateway (Envoy)<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant PreProc as payload-pre-processing<br/>9004/TCP gRPC TLS
    participant Kuadrant as Kuadrant Auth<br/>WasmPlugin
    participant PostProc as payload-processing<br/>9004/TCP gRPC TLS
    participant IPP as KServe InferencePool<br/>EPP
    participant Backend as Inference Backend

    Note over Client,Backend: Flow 1: Inference Request Processing (MaaS)

    Client->>Gateway: POST /v1/models/{model}:predict<br/>Auth: Bearer Token
    Gateway->>PreProc: gRPC ExtProc (pre-auth)<br/>TLS (self-signed)
    Note right of PreProc: model_to_header filter:<br/>extracts model ID from body,<br/>sets X-Gateway-Model-Name header
    PreProc-->>Gateway: Modified headers<br/>(X-Gateway-Model-Name added)
    Gateway->>Kuadrant: Token validation<br/>(in-process WasmPlugin)
    Kuadrant-->>Gateway: Auth result
    Gateway->>PostProc: gRPC ExtProc (post-auth)<br/>TLS (self-signed)
    Note right of PostProc: request_id filter:<br/>attaches request tracking ID
    PostProc-->>Gateway: Processed request/response
    Gateway->>IPP: Route via X-Gateway-Model-Name<br/>header-based endpoint selection
    IPP->>Backend: Forward to selected inference backend
    Backend-->>IPP: Inference response
    IPP-->>Gateway: Response
    Gateway-->>Client: JSON Response

    Note over Client,Backend: Flow 2: Health and Metrics

    participant Kubelet as Kubernetes Kubelet
    participant Prom as Prometheus<br/>(openshift-monitoring)

    Kubelet->>PostProc: gRPC Health Check<br/>50052/TCP plaintext
    PostProc-->>Kubelet: Serving / FIPS status
    Prom->>PostProc: GET /metrics<br/>9090/TCP HTTP
    PostProc-->>Prom: Prometheus text metrics
